      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly disheartening when it feels like your efforts are not being seen or that the fight is hopeless. While immediate change can feel impossible, sometimes talking to someone is not about winning a war, but simply about getting a small break from fighting it alone. Please consider that a professional can help you find ways to make the burden feel a little lighter, even if the bigger world doesn't change right away. Your need for relief and validation is real and important.",
      "source": "target",
