      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just... stop. not even in a dramatic way, just to not have to be this person in this world anymore. everything is just so loud and exhausting. it feels like i'm drowning and everyone is just telling me to learn how to swim better instead of seeing that the water is actually too deep. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just let go?",
